[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 840.069, "timestamp": "00:14:00", "text": "只播放日語，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 842.15, "timestamp": "00:14:02", "text": "還是只播放英語、日語，或兩者都播放？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 857.509, "timestamp": "00:14:17", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 859.75, "timestamp": "00:14:19", "text": "哦，等等，等等。是的，我的電腦應該已經恢復正常了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 862.069, "timestamp": "00:14:22", "text": "我的天哪。你看到了嗎？你看到了嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 864.949, "timestamp": "00:14:24", "text": "？我感覺自己像被凍住了一樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 867.43, "timestamp": "00:14:27", "text": "嗯，是的，我當時在看直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 870.55, "timestamp": "00:14:30", "text": "就像一點點。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 873.99, "timestamp": "00:14:33", "text": "所以，呃，這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 892.87, "timestamp": "00:14:52", "text": "直播狂，什麼？我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 895.189, "timestamp": "00:14:55", "text": "發生了什麼事？好了，我回來了。我回來了。  好的。好的。好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 897.59, "timestamp": "00:14:57", "text": "。 [嘆氣和倒吸氣] 太瘋狂了"}]